@startuml
title RPRRSBSI-V5 Ownership and the Ace Copy (Opus5_5, 2026-11-05)
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
package "ATAPUtilities (open templates, no owner columns)" #EEF6EE {
  rectangle "Template table T" as AT
  rectangle "Philote / PhiloteValidityPeriod\n(shared registry)" as PH
  rectangle "PublisherAttribution" as PA
}
package "Ace (full copy + Ace-only tables)" #FFF5E6 {
  rectangle "Ace.T (generated twin)\n+ OwnerUserId xor OwnerOrganizationId\n+ CreatedByUserId" as ACT
  rectangle "RowOwnershipState\n(temporal owner changes)" as ROS
  rectangle "RLS security policy per table\n(SESSION_CONTEXT caller)" as RLS
  rectangle "Ace-only tables\n(User, Organization, progress, ...)" as AO
  rectangle "AceDev_<user> developer schemas\n(DDL Authoring, owner-only)" as DEV
}
package "AceAuth (protected, outside Ace)" #FFE8E8 {
  rectangle "UserCredential, SignInAttempt, SignInEvent" as AUTH
}
AT ..> ACT : generator (SQL-kind materializer)\ncopy manifest + drift check
ACT ..> PH : PhiloteId
ACT ..> AT : derived-from-template (TemplateId, revision)
ROS ..> ACT
RLS ..> ACT
DEV ..> AT : bolt-on submission promotes\n(tables + selected template rows)
DEV ..> ACT : private rows moved at runtime
AT ..> PA
note bottom of AT : No foreign key from ATAPUtilities into Ace (V5-CORE-072)
@enduml
